    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>“You are called. You will answer.”</em></p><p><strong>Archetype (Bad Eden): Judgment (Reckoner).</strong> You are final account, exposure, and the terrifying moment when evasion ends. You force consequences to arrive on time.</p><h3>Archetype Effects</h3><ul><li><strong>Faction Edge.</strong> Your archetype strengthens revelation, decisive resolution, and moral or violent finality. This Archetype is associated with <strong>+1 Violence</strong> and <strong>+1 Faith</strong> in faction calculus.</li><li><strong>Tier Engine.</strong> See this Archetype’s Tier feats (Tier 1–4) for your full tactical and strategic toolkit.</li></ul>",
